[TITLE]
A pump curve and an inflow timeseries legally share the name "SHARED"
(legacy keeps CURVE and TSERIES in separate hash tables). References use
case-variant spellings; each must resolve to its own kind.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             03:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         5

[STORAGE]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  Shape       CurveCoeff  Exponent  Constant
STOR1   90    10        2          FUNCTIONAL  0           0         1000

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  Gated
OUT1    80    FREE  NO

[PUMPS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  PumpCurve  Status  Startup  Shutoff
P1      STOR1     OUT1    shared     ON      0        0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
STOR1   FLOW         SHARED      FLOW  1.0      1.0

[CURVES]
;;Name   Type   X     Y
SHARED   PUMP2  0     0
SHARED          2     4
SHARED          10    8

[TIMESERIES]
;;Name  Date  Time  Value
Shared        0:00  5
Shared        3:00  5

[REPORT]
INPUT  NO
